  KEY INSIGHT:
  D_n = (1/n!) × Σ_{σ≠id, all-odd-cycles} ct(σ) × Fix(σ) × (m - C(f(σ),2))
  The deficit measures how much non-trivial automorphisms reduce connectivity.

